<title>JAPAN: MOF says to hold T-bill auction on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>MOF says to hold T-bill auction on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan will hold a Treasury bill (T-bill) auction on Tuesday, an official for the Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Monday.</p>
<p>A market source said the T-bills to be offered in the auction will likely have a maturity of three months.</p>
<p>The issue amount is expected to be about 1.3 trillion yen, the market source said.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
